      "body": "Have similar issue. A code sample like this:\n```\n@client.on(events.NewMessage(incoming=True, chats=chat_list))\nasync def handler (event):\n    await event.message.forward_to(CHAT_ID)\n```\nkeeps forwarding the same incoming message forever. Expected to forward each incoming message only once. However if I try to reply to the incoming messages (`event.message.reply()`) it works as expected and only replies to incoming messages once per message.",
